SUMMARY:🦫⚽ THE GREAT BEAVER QUEST! ⚽🦫
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n# 🦫⚽ THE GREAT BEAVER QUEST! 
 ⚽🦫\n\n### Hunt for 52 Giant Beavers Across Downtown Toronto!\n\nThe F
 IFA World Cup is coming to Toronto\, and the city is celebrating in a uniq
 uely Canadian way... with **52 giant beaver sculptures** hidden throughout
  the downtown core!\n\nJoin us for **The Great Beaver Quest**\, a fun and 
 social walking adventure as we try to find as many of these public art ins
 tallations as possible.\n\nWe'll explore parts of downtown Toronto\, take 
 photos\, compare discoveries\, and see how many beavers we can track down 
 together.\n\nWhether you're a huge soccer fan\, a casual fan\, or someone 
 who couldn't tell a corner kick from a corner store\, this is a fun way to
  be part of the World Cup excitement while exploring the city and meeting 
 new people.\n\nThis is not a race and there are no prizes (other than brag
 ging rights 🦫)\, but we'll do our best to find as many beavers as possi
 ble during our adventure.\n\nAfter the walk\, we'll head over to **St. Law
 rence Market** for lunch where we can relax\, chat\, and compare our favou
 rite beaver sightings.\n\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group:** [Click here to
  join](http:/#)\n\n***\n\n## Meetup Details\n\n📍 **Meetup Location:** O
 utside the Elgin & Winter Garden Theatres\n🫎 **Look for the Moose Hat!*
 *\n⏰ **Meetup Time:** 11:00am\n⏰ **I will only wait 5 minutes.**\n🚶
  **Please be prepared to walk.** This is not a difficult walk\, but we wil
 l be covering a fair amount of distance over approximately 2 hours as we s
 earch for the beavers.\n💰 **Meetup Fee:** $5 cash in person or E-transf
 er\n📧 mathewmaclean@hotmail.com\n🏁 **Ending Spot:** St. Lawrence Mar
 ket\n📱 **Beaver Quest App:** [Click Here!](https://oldtowntoronto.ca/be
 averquest/)\n\n***\n\n## What To Expect\n\n🦫 Hunt for as many of the 52
  giant beavers as we can find\n📸 Lots of photo opportunities\n🚶 A fu
 n downtown walking adventure\n🤝 Meet new people and socialize\n⚽ A un
 ique way to experience Toronto's World Cup celebrations\n🍴 Lunch afterw
 ard at St. Lawrence\n\nMarket for anyone who would like to join us\n\n***\
 n\n## What To Bring\n\n💧 Water\n👟 Good walking shoes\n📱 A fully c
 harged phone for photos and the app\n🧢 Weather-appropriate clothing\n\n
 ***\n\nREMEMBER YOU CAN JUST SHOW UP OR SIGN UP ON THE DAY IF YOU ARE NOT 
 SURE YOU CAN MAKE IT.\nTHIS GROUP IS OPEN TO THOSE THAT WANT TO BE SOCIAL\
 , MAKE FRIENDS\, WHETHER YOU ARE SINGLE OR NOT.\n\nWE ALSO HAVE LOTS OF OT
 HER EVENTS INCLUDING MOVIES\, WALKS\, HIKES\, ARTS & CULTURE\, AND RESTAUR
 ANTS.\n\nNOTE: Sometimes things happen and I might have to cancel\, so ple
 ase keep an eye on the event page for updates.\n\nMathew is the organizer 
 for this meetup. If you need to contact him\, please post a message on the
  wall or email him at torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com.\n\n🦫⚽ Fift
 y-two beavers. One city. Countless photo opportunities. Let's see how many
  we can find! ⚽🦫
